// Strip ranges into LED_POS[]. kind: 0=helix, 1=canopy, 2=root, 3=strap/guy.
// axn: axial raster resolution for wrapped/folded strips (0 = index space).
// Canopy chain runs split at the mid-edge junction: bulbs [0,axsplit)
// run the spoke, bulbs [axsplit,count) are rim — axoff is their offset
// into the chain's rim particle array and axn its total bulb count.
